      "reasoning": "Only Warmaster can attack (everything else has summoning sickness). The opponent has a Feral Prowler (1/3) that could block and trade, and I'd rather keep Warmaster alive since it's my engine. But Prowler also has summoning sickness, so it can't block!\n\
