      "seq": 66,
      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Now I have 6 creatures total, but Elderleaf Mentor and 2 new tokens have summoning sickness. I can attack with Warmaster (2/2), Dwynen's Elite (2/2), and the 2 original Elf Warrior Tokens (1/1 each). That's 6 damage potential.\n\
\n\
Opponent has Initiate's Companion (3/1, sick - can block) and Feral Prowler (1/3, tapped - can't block). Only Companion can block, and it's 3/1 so it'll kill whatever it blocks but die to anything that deals 1 damage.\n\
\n\
If I send everything, opponent blocks one creature with Companion. Best case they block a 1/1 token (trading token for Companion). Worst case they block Warmaster.\n\
\n\
