      "reasoning": "Great! Presence of Gond is on Warmaster. Now for combat - opponent only has Oathsworn Vampire (2/2) but it's tapped, so they can't block at all! I should attack with everything EXCEPT Warmaster (I want to keep Warmaster back to tap for Elf tokens with Gond).\n\
