      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Beautiful! Archdruid is pumping everyone. My available attackers:\n\
- Elderleaf Mentor: 4/3\n\
- 4 Elf Warrior Tokens: 2/2 each (the 2 new ones are sick)\n\
\n\
So I can attack with Elderleaf Mentor (4/3) and 4 tokens (2/2 each). That's 4 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 12 damage! Opponent is at 7 life.\n\
\n\
Opponent has Canopy Stalker (4/2, sick - can block though!) and Oathsworn Vampire (2/2, tapped - can't block).\n\
\n\
Canopy Stalker (4/2) can block one creature. \"Must be blocked if able\" - wait, that's on Canopy Stalker when IT attacks. When defending, it can block normally. \n\
\n\
If they block a token with Canopy Stalker, they take 4+2+2+2 = 10 damage. Still lethal at 7 life!\n\
\n\
If they block Elderleaf Mentor with Canopy Stalker, they take 2+2+2+2 = 8 damage. Still lethal!\n\
\n\
No matter what they block, the remaining damage is lethal. Attack with all available!",
